        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7-5-1 Neither the Board nor any member of the administration shall take reprisals affecting the employment status or working conditions of any teacher, any party in interest, any Association representative, or any other participant in the grievance procedure by reason of such participation.",
